[{"title":"宫词 其一","author":"杨皇后","text":"瑞日曈眬散晓红，乾元万国佩丁东。\n紫宸北使班才退，百辟同趋德寿宫。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72316,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宫词 其十七","author":"杨皇后","text":"云影低涵柏子池，秋声轻度万年枝。\n要知玉宇凉多少，正在观书乙夜时。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72317,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宫词 其十","author":"杨皇后","text":"海棠花里奏琵琶，沉碧池边醉九霞。\n禁禦融融春日静，五云深护帝王家。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72318,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宫词 其十三","author":"杨皇后","text":"水殿钩帘四面风，荷花簇锦照人红。\n吾皇一曲薰弦罢，万俗泠泠解愠中。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72319,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题菊花册","author":"杨皇后","text":"莫惜朝来准酒钱，渊明身即是花仙。\n重阳满满杯中泛，一缕黄金是一年。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72320,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宫词 其八","author":"杨皇后","text":"一帘小雨怯春寒，禁禦深沉白昼闲。\n满地落花红不扫，黄鹂枝上语绵蛮。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72321,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宫词 其四十三","author":"杨皇后","text":"内园昨夜报花开，中外喧传玉辇来。\n遥望红妆撩乱处，人人争献万年杯。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72322,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宫词 其三十七","author":"杨皇后","text":"忽地君王喜气浓，秋千高挂百花丛。\n阿谁能逞翻飞态，便得称雄女队中。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72323,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宫词 其三十六","author":"杨皇后","text":"角黍冰盘饾饤装，酒阑昌歜泛瑶觞。\n近臣誇赐金书扇，御侍争传佩带香。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72324,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其二","author":"杨皇后","text":"线撚依依绿，金垂袅袅黄。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72325,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题漱玉轩","author":"杨祖尧","text":"危石欲阽力自支，罅空引溜日夜垂。\n空阶滴雨幽梦觉，孤蓬澎浪惊魂飞。\n直疑丹液閟石骨，饮此合仙寿无期。\n又疑龙宫流润泽，膏沐万物皆含滋。\n终古不受一尘涴，六月可逃三伏威。\n濯我尘缨洗两耳，审听广乐音声希。\n盥颒半生尘俗面，要离仙仗翻云旗。\n仁智所观自有感，物理天理常参稽。\n华池神水倘若此，圣功合发天人机。\n湔涤众生业障尽，更与大地荡劫灰。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72326,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题武夷","author":"杨绕善","text":"说尽东南第一峰，武夷端与画图同。\n幔亭烟带凌霄紫，玉女霜花照水红。\n渔父攲残溪涧冷，仙人蜕久洞岩空。\n飞尘马足何时已，安得诛茅深翠中。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72327,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"醉蓬莱 夏寿太守","author":"杨绘","text":"对亭台幽雅，水竹清虚，嫩凉轻透。\n碧沼红蕖，送香风盈袖。\n白首冯唐，诞辰同庆，上百分仙酎。\n鳌禁词垣，乌台谏省，昔游俱旧。\n千里长沙，五年湓浦，近捧丝纶，更藩移守。\n桂苑馀芳，有孙枝新秀。\n罗绮雍容，管弦松脆，愿拜延椿寿。\n岁岁年年，今朝启宴，欢荣良久。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72328,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"刘敬子心所题桂林栖霞洞诗见寄梦想之馀次韵奉酬","author":"杨绛","text":"从教扰扰校亏成，且可蘧蘧了死生。\n八极神游应有分，几时杖屦得同行。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72329,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"垂虹亭","author":"杨绛","text":"垂虹临绝景，仙隐寄人间。\n远水吞平野，归云补断山。\n空明宽眼界，秀迥破天悭。\n深羡鸱夷子，扁舟竟不还。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72330,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"绝句","author":"杨适","text":"尖头奴有五兄弟，十八公生四客卿。\n过我书斋无一事，似应终日待陶泓。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72331,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"梅","author":"杨适","text":"冷冷疏疏雪里春，不轻吹笛付伶伦。\n出墙幽独窥邻女，临水横斜览镜人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72332,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"雪","author":"杨适","text":"渡桥已看银河冻，上马争如玉凤飞。\n莫说兔园延赋客，不须鹤氅作仙衣。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72333,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送孙伯野","author":"杨适","text":"清议岂徒光四户，直声应已到三韩。\n黄门有手能批敕，太学无人为举幡。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72334,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"中秋夜与赵鼎臣狄端叔月下联句句 其二","author":"杨适","text":"冰肌销瘦为谁愁。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72335,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"长相思 题丈亭馆","author":"杨适1","text":"南山明。\n北山明。\n中有长亭号丈亭。\n沙边供送迎。\n东江清。\n西江清。\n海上潮来两岸平。\n行人分棹行。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72336,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"南柯子/南歌子 送淮漕向伯恭","author":"杨适2","text":"怨草迷南浦，愁花傍短亭。\n有情歌酒莫催行。\n看取无情花草、也关情。\n旧日临岐曲，而今忍泪听。\n淮山何在暮云凝。\n待倩春风吹梦、过江城。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72337,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题涪州石鱼","author":"杨郡守","text":"邀客西津上，观鱼出水初。\n长江多巨石，此地近仙居。\n所记皆名笔，为祥旧□书。\n丰年知有验，遗秉利将舒。\n戏草春波静，双鳞乐意徐。\n不才叨郡寄，燕喜愧萧疏。","collection":"宋","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72338,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"郎官岩","author":"杨埙","text":"碧玉莫遮千嶂石，黄金难买一溪云。\n歌钟沸地徒誇盛，争似松风竟夕闻。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72339,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"青莲山","author":"杨埙","text":"拨开瑟瑟青萝帐，寻得磷磷白石梯。\n更入云霞最深处，忘机数日遂幽栖。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72340,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"碧涧亭","author":"杨埙","text":"妙笔王维图莫就，多才康乐咏难穷。\n楼台一簇出云杪，激雪浪生寒涧风。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72341,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"经略龙图开拓曾公岩景物一新遂为诸岩之冠因成拙诗投之","author":"杨损","text":"阳岩高敞纳晨曦，鹤驾云軿或可期。\n神物雕镌元入妙，人工开辟更增奇。\n须知水石清凉处，绝胜尘沙热恼时。\n红旆碧幢劳小驻，多惭下客滥追随。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72342,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"马冠山","author":"杨谆","text":"陈家宅废桑畦暗，马道冠亡羽观空。\n惟有山南古程氏，雕檐一簇翠烟中。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72343,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"金鸡石","author":"杨起莘","text":"千年古石号金鸡，化雨霏霏长羽仪。\n不把稻粱为食啄，且将天地作笼栖。\n祥云架上非孤立，入晓声中岂乱啼。\n过客莫同凡鸟看，等閒飞到凤凰池。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72344,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"郡舍偶书","author":"杨偕","text":"偃息铃斋度岁华，著书人尽笑聱牙。\n斯文自信惊天地，吾道谁知系国家。\n独爱杉篁寒不变，更怜江海阔无涯。\n因思朝市争名地，何似优游刺史衙。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72345,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"九里岭","author":"杨寅","text":"上下各九里，东西只数家。\n田横梯齿密，松列雁行斜。\n分镳争岭道，孤往接天涯。\n为我谢风景，何路不开花。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72346,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"龙云寺次罗竦韵","author":"杨寅","text":"路转羊肠望眼舒，篮舆更入道人居。\n千林黄叶新霜后，四面青山夕照馀。\n幽梦乍惊鱼鼓响，小诗闲向竹窗书。\n炉烟茗碗匆匆话，已觉人间万象虚。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72347,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句","author":"杨晨","text":"结网㜷教女，操舟罢诟男。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72348,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"乡禅嵩老集古人佳句成诗编成巨帙以示余钦叹不足辄赋二绝率然悚仄 其一","author":"杨梦信","text":"胸中历历古人诗，妙用纵横自一机。\n管得杜韩惊且泣，斓斑要作百家衣。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72349,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句","author":"杨符","text":"吏道官官恶，田家事事贤。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72350,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄僧琴山","author":"杨紬林","text":"闽海西来山复山，白云深处见禅关。\n幽岩风细莺声缓，古寺春深鹤梦閒。\n游子从来悲草绿，老僧浑不计花残。\n笑余犹是红尘客，尽日攀跻行路难。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72351,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和燕龙图海棠","author":"杨谔","text":"西汉欺卢橘，东阳爱野棠。\n许昌奇此遇，子美欠先扬。\n杜宇三春艳，蚕丛一国香。\n燕脂点乱雨，猩色丽斜阳。\n富艳东君节，暄妍白帝方。\n锦楼祈水色，玉垒换山光。\n风格林檎细，腰支郁李长。\n天生笑容质，时样舞衣裳。\n少吐深深染，全开淡淡妆。\n烟媒护绿蒂，风阵损朱房。\n旋失因临水，閒飘弗过墙。\n佩亡愁杀甫，簪脱即连姜。\n蝶舞菱花照，莺啼罨画堂。\n仙如弄玉少，坠似绿珠常。\n不见还成悔，相思几欲狂。\n春深濯锦水，日晚浣纱坊。\n卧对移帘押，吟看近笔床。\n池清满园倒，鸟起一枝昂。\n紫燕衔泥急，黄蜂趁蜜忙。\n化工真用意，销得与携觞。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72352,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其三","author":"杨谔","text":"行人问宫殿，耕者得珠玑。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72353,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其一","author":"杨谔","text":"草不惊皇辙，山能护帝舆。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72354,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其四","author":"杨谔","text":"遥观一郡色，尽得二江声。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72355,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵卢彦德学宫诗","author":"杨辅","text":"颇怪诸生籍奉常，寂寥科目岁年长。\n只今五桂名犹在，恐有孤桐曲未忘。\n学校规模新壮丽，江山意气久徊翔。\n分光肤使青瑶句，收拾风霆唤阿香。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72356,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"南溪","author":"杨辅世","text":"碧玉寒塘瑩不流，红蕖影里立沙鸥。\n便当不作南溪看，当得西湖十里秋。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72357,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"与主簿叔蔬饮联句","author":"杨万里","text":"蕨含春味紫如椽，酒入春风浪似山。\n未信乾坤非细物，小吞螺浦半杯间。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72358,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"一丈红","author":"杨巽斋","text":"红白青黄弄浅深，旌分幢列自成阴。\n但疑承露惊殊色，谁识倾阳无二心。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72359,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"万蝶花","author":"杨巽斋","text":"粉翼纷纷簇几丛，摇风欲趁卖花翁。\n诗眸览倦方攲枕，栩栩犹疑在梦中。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72360,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"太平花","author":"杨巽斋","text":"紫芝奇树谩前闻，未若斯花叶气薰。\n种向春台岂无象，望中秀色似卿云。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72361,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"玉绣毬","author":"杨巽斋","text":"纷纷红紫斗芳菲，争似团酥越样奇。\n料想花神闲戏击，误随风起坠繁枝。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72362,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"红钵盂花","author":"杨巽斋","text":"帢匝枝头簇绛英，朱髹梵器上天成。\n槛边更种蛮姜叶，依约如归佛手擎。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72363,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"佛手花","author":"杨巽斋","text":"丹葩点漆细馨浮，苍叶轻排指样柔。\n香案净瓶安顿了，还能摩顶济人不。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72364,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"佛见笑花","author":"杨巽斋","text":"芳葩丰美折轻红，想是祇园秀气钟。\n解使金仙犹动色，窥阑谁不解愁容。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72365,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寿春花","author":"杨巽斋","text":"花间碧玉最敷腴，看挹南薰景又殊。\n天赋芳姿长不老，命名为寿定非诬。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72366,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"杜鹃花","author":"杨巽斋","text":"鲜红滴滴映霞明，尽是冤禽血染成。\n羁客有家归未得，对花无语两含情。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72367,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"鸡冠花","author":"杨巽斋","text":"濯濯高花染血猩，却怜金距起闲争。\n宋家窗下宜栽此，莫问临风不解鸣。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72368,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"茉莉花","author":"杨巽斋","text":"脐麝龙涎韵不侔，薰风移植自南州。\n谁家浴罢临妆女，爱把閒花带满头。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72369,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"金钱菊","author":"杨巽斋","text":"清晓幽丛露作团，篱边积叠喜人看。\n落英欲买真无价，唯许骚人罄一餐。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72370,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"南天竺花","author":"杨巽斋","text":"花发朱明雨后天，结成红颗更轻圆。\n人间热恼谁医得，正要清香净业缘。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72371,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"真珠花","author":"杨巽斋","text":"累累花发映庭除，柳带榆钱总不如。\n一任春风吹满地，幽人步履自虚徐。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72372,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"荷花","author":"杨巽斋","text":"翠盖红幢耀日鲜，西湖佳丽会群仙。\n波平十里铺云锦，风度清香趁画船。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72373,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"密友花","author":"杨巽斋","text":"黄花端逼菊花真，朵朵相迎意更亲。\n情似春浓非淡泊，何妨呼酒对佳宾。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72374,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"御仙花","author":"杨巽斋","text":"不逐凡花逞艳娇，移根上苑独清高。\n君王曾选装金带，侈锡持荷耀紫袍。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72375,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"满堂春","author":"杨巽斋","text":"花发围眸昼锦如，列仙行缀在蓬壶。\n千金须拚豪家赏，一笑春风无向隅。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72376,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"锦带花 其二","author":"杨巽斋","text":"鹄袍换绿契初心，旋赐银绯与紫金。\n堪念纷纷名利客，对花应是叹侵寻。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72377,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"锦带花 其一","author":"杨巽斋","text":"万钉簇锦若垂绅，围住东风稳称身。\n闻道沈腰易宽减，何妨留与系青春。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72378,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"碧蝉儿花","author":"杨巽斋","text":"扬葩簌簌傍疏篱，薄翅舒青势欲飞。\n几误佳人将扇扑，始知错认枉心机。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72379,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"薝卜花","author":"杨巽斋","text":"薝卜标名自宝坊，薰风开遍一庭霜。\n閒来扫地跏趺坐，受用此花无尽香。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72380,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"蜡梅","author":"杨巽斋","text":"香蜜栽葩分外工，疏枝数点缀雏蜂。\n娇黄染就宫妆样，香暖犹宜爱日烘。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72381,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"滚绣毬","author":"杨巽斋","text":"琢玉英标不染尘，光涵月影愈清新。\n青皇宴罢呈馀技，抛向东风展转频。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72382,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其一","author":"杨巽斋","text":"自有娇红间苍叶，不随凡卉待春回。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72383,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"婆罗门引","author":"杨景","text":"帐云暮卷，漏声不到小帘栊。\n银汉夜洗晴空。\n皓月堂轩高挂，秋入广寒宫。\n正金波不动，桂影玲珑。\n佳人未逢。\n怅此夕、与谁同。\n对酒当歌，追念霜满愁红。\n南楼何处，愁人在、横笛一声中。\n凝望眼、立尽西风。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72384,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句","author":"杨希仲","text":"回环万木森幢盖，缥缈三山落市廛。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72385,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"黄燕山","author":"杨琛","text":"苍苍终日锁春愁，欲去回翔更少留。\n传说王家饲燕女，今朝珠报始知由。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72386,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"齐山","author":"杨缄","text":"池阳佳致说齐山，公暇邀朋喜暂攀。\n浮世谩同流水急，野僧长伴白云闲。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72387,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句","author":"杨缄","text":"一从天上遗金籍，长向人间作画屏。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72388,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"浣溪沙 钱唐有感","author":"杨舜举","text":"残照西风一片愁。\n疏杨画出六桥秋。\n游人不上十三楼。\n有泪金仙还泣汉，无心玉马已朝周。\n平湖寂寂水空流。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72389,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句","author":"杨遂","text":"愿侯辑百福，长与民为霖。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72390,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}}]